    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel in a zombie setting with deep story, base management, survival and adult content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three years have passed since the zombie uprising.\u00a0You managed to escape the chaos and survive in an isolated cabin in the woods, all alone, for better and for worse. Until one day you come across a young zombie who doesn't seem entirely lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261030/extras/b49eb0eb6f7480cf5c2582a3ebedb1ef.avif?t=1732791316\" width=500 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide to temporarily make room for her, attend to her needs, try to educate and humanize her, and, perhaps, seek a future together. Human or zombie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261030/extras/6effff6346b1d3bfd215c51c1b14b472.avif?t=1732791316\" width=500 height=283 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to lead this adventure, face multiple endings, and consider how far you are willing to risk your humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
